     "<div dir=\"auto\"><div>Dear Ingo, my thanks for the clarification!</div><div dir=\"auto\">Best wishes, </div><div dir=\"auto\">Alexander</div><div dir=\"auto\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\" dir=\"auto\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Sun, 26 Mar 2023, 15:49 , &lt;<a href rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\" data-email-masked>qcaw...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #d3d3d3;max-width:850px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000\">\r\n  <div style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5;padding:10px 20px\">\r\n    <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%\">\r\n      <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <td style=\"width:70%\">\r\n            <span style=\"font:18px/20px arial;color:#333333\">\r\n              <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email#!forum/qcawithr/topics\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:#333333\" rel=\"noreferrer noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail%23!forum/qcawithr/topics&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494732285000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1bjqW-0whFp1vQZmHA0o0T\">\r\n              qcaw...@googlegroups.com</a>\r\n            </span>\r\n          </td>\r\n          <td style=\"text-align:right;width:30%\">\r\n            <span style=\"font:20px/24px arial\"><a style=\"color:#dd4b39;text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email/#!overview\" rel=\"noreferrer noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail/%23!overview&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494732285000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3-BOL1hy8_FOmnc5ADPHIv\">Google Groups</a></span>\r\n          </td>\r\n          <td style=\"width:32px\">\r\n            <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email/#!overview\" rel=\"noreferrer noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail/%23!overview&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494732285000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3-BOL1hy8_FOmnc5ADPHIv\"><img style=\"border:0;vertical-align:middle\" src=\"https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/4SGWHe9midrWMDxDIJMQraTMMgnAU71soPZ0D28IOSZcs66TdyRoCqyIhaTt-kwo0YKv2lRo05RkwsGFZdnFhdvy60XdxNlL2U-B=s0-d-e1-ft#http://www.google.com/images/icons/product/groups-32.png\"></a>\r\n          </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n      </tbody>\r\n    </table>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div style=\"padding:20px;background-color:#f5f5f5\">\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:arial;color:#222222;padding:0px\">\r\n  <a name=\"m_-8050010565563217512_m_6663535269102911239_m_3312007819261691883_digest_top\" style=\"font-size:21px\" rel=\"noreferrer noreferrer nofollow\">\r\n  \r\n  \r\n    Topic digest\r\n  \r\n  </a><br>\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:11px\">\r\n    <a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email#!forum/qcawithr/topics\" rel=\"noreferrer noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail%23!forum/qcawithr/topics&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494732285000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1bjqW-0whFp1vQZmHA0o0T\">View all topics</a>\r\n  </span>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font:13px/18px arial;color:#222222;padding:0px;margin-bottom:30px\">\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-left:3px;padding-left:0px\">\r\n  \r\n    <li>\r\n      <a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_-8050010565563217512_m_6663535269102911239_m_3312007819261691883_group_thread_0\" rel=\"noreferrer noreferrer nofollow\">\r\n      conceptual question SUIN</a> -\r\n      <span style=\"color:#777777\">1 Update</span>\r\n    </li>\r\n  \r\n  </ul>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  <a name=\"m_-8050010565563217512_m_6663535269102911239_m_3312007819261691883_group_thread_0\" rel=\"noreferrer noreferrer nofollow\"></a>\r\n  <div style=\"display:inline-block;font-family:arial;padding:4px 0 5px 0px\">\r\n  \r\n    <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/qcawithr/t/652fdd5add3ac191?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" style=\"font-size:21px;color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" rel=\"noreferrer noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/qcawithr/t/652fdd5add3ac191?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494732285000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1aq-LNVPQkYOaGUoBhEf1G\">\r\n      conceptual question SUIN\r\n    </a>\r\n  \r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\r\n    \r\n      <tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;color:#2e2e2e;font-family:arial;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid #d3d3d3\">\r\n        <span style=\"color:#b1b0b0;font-size:15px\">\r\n          Ingo Rohlfing &lt;<a href rel=\"noreferrer noreferrer nofollow\" data-email-masked>ingo.r...@uni-passau.de</a>&gt;: Mar 25 03:20PM +0100\r\n        </span>\r\n        <br><br>\r\n        If you want to test a specific disjunction for being SUIN, I would <br>\r\ncreate it by hand and feed it into the QCAfit() function. If there are <br>\r\nmultiple disjunctions or the SUIN analysis is exploratory, I suggest <br>\r\nusing superSubset() from the QCA package. You can negate the outcome <br>\r\nwith ~ and you can determine how many disjunctions you want to see by <br>\r\nchoosing the minimum level of consistency, coverage and ron.<br>\r\n <br>\r\nKind regards<br>\r\n <br>\r\nIngo<br>\r\n <br>\r\nAm 24.03.2023 um 16:20 schrieb Alexander Strelkov:<br>\r\n <br>\r\n-- <br>\r\nProfessor für Methoden der Empirischen Sozialforschung (Methods for Empirical Social Research)<br>\r\nphone: <a href=\"tel:+49%20851%205092720\" value=\"+498515092720\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+49 851 5092720</a><br>\r\nfax: <a href=\"tel:+49%20851%205092722\" value=\"+498515092722\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+49 851 5092722</a><br>\r\nPhilosophische Fakultät<br>\r\nInnstr. 41<br>\r\nUniversität Passau<br>\r\nD-94032 Passau<br>\r\npersonal website:<a href=\"https://ingorohlfing.wordpress.com\" rel=\"noreferrer noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://ingorohlfing.wordpress.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494732285000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Sh6Z0lzsdpyNTryH7rjmm\">https://ingorohlfing.wordpress.com</a><br>\r\n\r\n      </td></tr>\r\n    \r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  <div style=\"font-size:11px;margin-bottom:40px;margin-top:5px\">\r\n    <a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_-8050010565563217512_m_6663535269102911239_m_3312007819261691883_digest_top\" rel=\"noreferrer noreferrer nofollow\">Back to top</a>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5;padding:5px 20px\">\r\n  <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%\">\r\n  <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td style=\"padding-top:4px;font-family:arial,sans-serif;color:#636363;font-size:11px\">\r\n      \r\n      You received this digest because you&#39;re subscribed to updates for this group. You can change your settings on the <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email#!forum/qcawithr/join\" style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" rel=\"noreferrer noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail%23!forum/qcawithr/join&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494732285000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3y_Sso4YH1h__VVEsYnhND\">group membership page</a>.<br>\r\n      To unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it send an email to <a href rel=\"noreferrer noreferrer nofollow\" data-email-masked>qcawithr+u...@googlegroups.com</a>.\r\n    </td>\r\n  </tr></tbody>\r\n  </table>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</blockquote></div></div></div>\r\n"
